      "license_local_kind": "full-text | header-only | none",
      "license_remote": "URL of the license text in the upstream repository",
      "note": "free-form note: authorship, fork origin, compliance gaps, branch assumptions"
    },
    "notes": [
      "The top-level \"unbundled_dependencies\" array lists pip packages that are NOT shipped in the bundle: they are installed into the user's own environment (requirements.txt = runtime, requirements-dev.txt = build/test, per-processor requirements = optional). Kept as a short reference only; each package ships its own license text in its installed .dist-info, not in this repo.",
